Title: Agreement Is Not Accuracy.
Note: Four executions agree bit for bit on a decision that exact real arithmetic would make the other way, and then
Note: refuse, all four alike, to turn the float into a fixed value it does not exactly equal.
§1 Decimals are floats.
§2 Let a be 0.1 plus 0.2.
§3 If a equals 0.3, say "float: equal".
§4 Otherwise, say "float: not equal".
§5 Let c be a as a fixed.
